PC321 ZigBee Power Clamp helps you monitor the amount of electricity usage in your facility by connecting the clamp on to the power cable. It can also measure Voltage, Current, PowerFactor, ActivePower.

## Key Features

- ZigBee 3.0 compliant
- Extend the range and strengthen ZigBee network communication
- Single/3 - phase electricity compatible
- Three current transformers for Single phase application
- Measures real-time Voltage, Current, PowerFactor, ActivePower and total energy consumption
- Statistical historical energy consumption
- Suitable for both residential and commercial application
- Optional antenna to enhance the signal strength
- Lightweight and easy to install
